      "name": "News Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "news-card",
      "description": "White card on cream; DM Serif title, lifts with shadow on hover.",
      "html": "<div style=\"background:#f4efe2;padding:24px\"><a class=\"ds-news\" href=\"#\"><div class=\"ds-news-img\"></div><div class=\"ds-news-body\"><span class=\"ds-news-meta\">06 Out · Futebol</span><h3>Meldina vence o Sete Lagos</h3><p>Três gols e liderança mantida.</p></div></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-news{display:flex;flex-direction:column;max-width:340px;background:#fff;color:#0b0d1c;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .4s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.1, 1),box-shadow .4s}.ds-news:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 24px 50px -24px rgba(11,13,28,0.45)}.ds-news:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #efaa19;outline-offset:3px}.ds-news-img{aspect-ratio:16/10;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#5a000a,#040720)}.ds-news-body{padding:22px 24px 26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}.ds-news-meta{font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;font-size:0.72rem;color:#6b6f86;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600}.ds-news h3{font-family:'DM Serif Display',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:1.42rem;line-height:1.18;margin:0}.ds-news p{margin:0;color:#4a4d63;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;font-size:0.92rem}"
    },
