      "description": "Signature: grená wash, outlined shirt number, Anton name, gold sweep bar on hover.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-player\"><span class=\"ds-player-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"ds-player-info\"><span class=\"ds-player-pos\">Meia</span><span class=\"ds-player-name\">Carrijo</span></span><span class=\"ds-player-bar\"></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-player{position:relative;display:block;width:240px;aspect-ratio:3/4;overflow:hidden;border-radius:4px;border:0;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;color:#fff;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 35%,#b0101f 0%,#8f0010 45%,#5a000a 100%)}.ds-player::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(4,7,32,0.97) 0%,rgba(90,0,10,0.35) 40%,transparent 62%)}.ds-player-num{position:absolute;top:8px;right:14px;font-family:Anton,Impact,sans-serif;font-size:7.4rem;line-height:0.9;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px rgba(239,170,25,0.35);transition:-webkit-text-stroke-color .4s}.ds-player:hover .ds-player-num{-webkit-text-stroke-color:rgba(239,170,25,0.8)}.ds-player-info{position:absolute;left:20px;right:20px;bottom:18px;z-index:3}.ds-player-pos{display:block;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;font-size:0.7rem;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#efaa19;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px}.ds-player-name{display:block;font-family:Anton,Impact,sans-serif;font-size:2.2rem;line-height:0.95;text-transform:uppercase}.ds-player-bar{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;height:4px;width:100%;z-index:4;background:#efaa19;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.1, 1)}.ds-player:hover .ds-player-bar{transform:scaleX(1)}.ds-player:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #efaa19;outline-offset:3px}"
